sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer
    participant A as App
    participant P as Primary
    participant R as Replica
    C->>A: place order
    A->>P: INSERT, COMMIT
    P-->>A: order 1000042
    A->>R: SELECT order 1000042
    R-->>A: no rows
    A-->>C: "order not found"
    P-)R: WAL with the commit
    Note over R: replayed ~1.5 ms<br/>after the COMMIT
